eam/apps/3096150/extras/bd0ca1ec7e58711cf9df9fbbbe58d9f6.apng?t=1773503731\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/bd0ca1ec7e58711cf9df9fbbbe58d9f6.poster.avif?t=1773503731\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=16 /></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Online</strong> - Make new rivals or challenge friends in the online versus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/85ac5e2ce1297cb3ef63549a356537eb.apng?t=1773503731\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/85ac5e2ce1297cb3ef63549a356537eb.poster.avif?t=1773503731\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=16 /></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Mission</strong> - Take on over 100 puzzles and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/472ce6b8456bc628fb734ba0410922b2.apng?t=1773503731\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/472ce6b8456bc628fb734ba0410922b2.poster.avif?t=1773503731\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=16 /></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Arcade</strong> - Battle the High Rollers in this classic arcade-style mode against CPU opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/3977ea6ac323293516bf4f12b3e9f22f.apng?t=1773503731\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/3977ea6ac323293516bf4f12b3e9f22f.poster.avif?t=1773503731\" class=\"bb_img\" width=18 height=16 /></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Lessons</strong> - Learn everything from the basics to advanced techniques across 30+ lessons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb